# income is already set for you
tax = 0
```
solution:
```python
if income <= 10000:
    tax = 0
elif income <= 40000:
    tax = (income - 10000) * 0.2
elif income <= 100000:
    tax = 6000 + (income - 40000) * 0.4
else:
    tax = 30000 + (income - 100000) * 0.45
```
